          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Are nicotine pouches legal in the UK?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Nicotine pouches are fully legal consumer products in the UK. They're not classed as tobacco (they contain no tobacco), and the MHRA regulates them as consumer items, not medicines. You must be 18+ to purchase. The Tobacco and Vapes Bill may introduce new regulations, but bans are unlikely given UK harm reduction policy.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Do you need to be 18 to buy nicotine pouches in the UK?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Age verification is required at purchase, both in-store and online. UK retailers use ID checks or age-gating software. It's illegal to sell nicotine pouches to under-18s.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Where can I buy nicotine pouches in the UK?</h3>
          <p>Three options: (1) UK supermarkets — Nordic Spirit at Tesco, Sainsbury's, Asda, Morrisons; (2) UK specialist shops — larger selection, lower prices, found in most city centres; (3) Online — UK retailers for fastest delivery (1–2 days) or SnusFriend for largest selection (3–5 days + possible customs). We provide a full guide at <a href="/nicotine-pouches">/nicotine-pouches</a>.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Will nicotine pouches be banned in the UK?</h3>
          <p>Very unlikely. The UK government's stance on harm reduction is significantly more permissive than the EU. Public Health England has recognized nicotine pouches as a lower-harm alternative to cigarettes. While the Tobacco and Vapes Bill may introduce new oversight, bans are not on the horizon.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">How much do nicotine pouches cost in the UK?</h3>
          <p>Supermarkets: £4.50–£6.00 per can (10–20 pouches). UK online retailers: £2.80–£4.50 per can. Bulk orders (10+ cans) drop to £2.00–£3.50 per can. SnusFriend bulk pricing starts at £2.00 per can before customs VAT.</p>

          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold mt-4">Is there customs duty ordering pouches from EU to UK?</h3>
